  to 0.8°N. The builder makes Abkhazia the zone ABKHAZIA, which the shipped border table closes for everyone.

  One secondary road (60 km/h) along 0.5°N from 0.2°E to 1.8°E, through Abkhazia, with a checkpoint
  (barrier=border_control) on each side of it:

    0.2°E – 0.995°E (barrier) – 1.01°E – 1.39°E – 1.41°E (barrier) – 1.8°E

  0.1° of longitude is 11.12 km here, 667.1 s at the wheel. In whole seconds at the wheel: 0.2–0.995 5304,
  0.995–1.01 100, 1.01–1.39 2535, 1.39–1.41 133, 1.41–1.8 2602.

    From the west end, the last node before Abkhazia, 0.995°E, is at 6365 s: 1.768 h of travel, maxHours 2. Were
    Abkhazia open, the whole road would take 10674 s at the wheel, 3.558 h, and 6.558 h with two borders: maxHours 7.
    The 2 h ring holds the land near the road from 0.65°E to 0.995°E and up to 1 km from 0.995°E: 0.7 km from it
    is 0.03 h more. That takes in Abkhazia's edge, as far as 1.004°E, but the ring stays out of it.

       1°N +-----------------------------------------------+
           |   GEO        +-----------+                    |
    0.5°N  |     .--------b-.  ABKHAZIA .-b-----------.    |
           |              +-----------+                    |
        0° +-----------------------------------------------+
          0°   0.2°E     1°E         1.4°E       1.8°E    2°E
-->
